<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1002M_S001G" variety="S001G">
<name>Pre-crash Safety</name>
<ttl id="1002M_S001G_74WT7_T00FP" variety="T00FP">
<name>Pre-crash Safety System</name>
<para id="RM000000DBA00JX" category="C" type-id="8007P" name-id="540JG-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>B2056/31</dtccode>
<dtcname>Radar Sensor Axis Misalignment</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000DBA00JX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CUK00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Detection Time</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B2056/31</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Millimeter wave radar sensor assembly malfunction or improper initialization</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 seconds (sensor self-diagnosis when driving at approximately 45km/h for 8 hours)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Millimeter Wave Radar Sensor Assembly Beam Axis Adjustment</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Seat Belt Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000DBA00JX_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CUL00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly is replaced with a new one, always perform beam axis adjustment of the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly.</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000028Z6003X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the distance control computer assembly is replaced with a new one, be sure to perform initialization.</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000002GO2003X_01_0001"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000DBA00JX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CUN00000">
<testtitle>Radar Axis Adjustment</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform beam axis adjustment of the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly.</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000028Z6003X_01_0001"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0001" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CUM00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Check DTCs (Radar Cruise Control System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the prompts on the screen to display the "System Diagnosis Menu/Pre-crash" screen, and select "DTC".</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen to clear the data.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Follow the prompts on the SST (TaSCAN) screen to display the "System Diagnosis Menu/Pre-crash" screen, and select "DTC".</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check for DTCs again.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC B2056 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC B2056 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the DTC is output again after the DTC detection conditions are met following beam axis adjustment of the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly, vehicle body distortion, wheel alignment, the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly or the seat belt control computer may be malfunctioning.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0009" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0011" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0009">
<testtitle>Replace Millimeter Wave Radar Sensor Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000028Z9003X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000DBA00JX_04_0011">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>